    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50439" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vĕnĭālis</span></b> ,
		e, adj.
		venia (post-class.). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Gracious</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pax,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 28, 5, 3</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Serv. ad Verg. A. 4,
			333</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Pardonable</i>, <i>venial</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ista translatio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 7, 16</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quidam errores,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sid. Ep. 8, 11</span></i>
			.</div>
